          }
        ],
        "text": "The central issue is whether the respondents have standing to challenge the Department\u2019s HEROES Act loan\u2011forgiveness plan on procedural grounds."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
