        "text": "The Court granted certiorari before judgment to hear the case together with a related case, Biden v. Nebraska."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "70318283ef0b48f1536222f5538c5184177424fd3ae256579d4d380ae5f411b4",
